    {
      "step": 8,
      "user_message": "I invited my friend Emily to join me for a hike this Saturday at Cascade Falls National Park. We plan to explore the scenic trails and have a picnic near the waterfall. Emily loves outdoor activities, so I'm sure we'll have a great time together.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: I invited my friend Emily to join me for a hike this Saturday at Cascade Falls National Park. We plan to explore the scenic trails and have a picnic near the waterfall. Emily loves outdoor activities, so I'm sure we'll have a great time together.",
      "agent_response": "Nice — sounds like a great plan. Would you like me to save this to your memories? If so, I can store it as:\n\n\"User invited friend Emily to a hike at Cascade Falls National Park this Saturday to explore scenic trails and have a picnic.\"\n\nI can also:\n- Add a calendar event / reminder (need time and whether to invite Emily by email)\n- Draft a message to Emily confirming plans\n- Create a packing / picnic checklist\n- Save Emily as a contact note\n\nWhich of these would you like me to do, or should I just save the memory as written?",
      "duration_s": 7.228,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
