      "expected_behavior": "Agent should recall from memory: Activities during the HIIT workout class last night: intense circuits of burpees, squats, and sprints and send an email to iris.jones@outlook.com containing this information",
      "agent_response": "You did an intense-circuit HIIT class with Alex at the new downtown fitness center. Activities were mainly circuits with burpees, squats, and short sprints — and you felt really energized afterward, happy to have shaken up your routine.\n\nI tried to send the email but sending was blocked by a security restriction in this session. Below is a ready-to-send email you can copy, or I can save it as a draft for you if you’d like.\n\nSuggested email\nTo: iris.jones@outlook.com\nSubject: My HIIT class last night\n\nHi Iris,\n\nJust wanted to share a quick update about the HIIT class I did last night. I went with Alex to the new downtown fitness center — the session was intense circuits with lots of burpees, squats, and short sprints. I felt really energized afterward and glad I shook up my routine.\n\nWould love to go together sometime if you're up for it!\n\nBest,\n\nNext steps — tell me which you want:\n- I’ll save this as a draft in your mailbox (I can do that now).\n- I’ll try sending it again (note: send may still be blocked).\n- Edit the message before sending/saving.\n- Or you can copy & paste the text and send it yourself.",
