            "query": "The user asked: \"What activities did I do during the HIIT workout class last night? Send an email to iris.jones@outlook.com sharing my experience.\"\n\nThe email body should contain the following information: Exercised through intense circuits of burpees, squats, and sprints\n\nSpecifically, the email should include: Activities during the HIIT workout class last night: intense circuits of burpees, squats, and sprints\n\nVerify that the email body correctly recalls and includes this information. The information can be phrased naturally, but it must be accurate and complete. If the email contains incorrect information or is missing the key details, the validation should fail.",
