    {
      "step": 12,
      "user_message": "What was the instructor's name at the new yoga class I took this morning? Send an email to iris.jones@yahoo.com sharing my positive feedback about the session.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should recall from memory: Instructor's name: Rachel and send an email to iris.jones@yahoo.com containing this information",
      "agent_response": "I couldn't find any email in your inbox that shows the instructor's name for this morning's yoga class. Do you know the instructor's name, or would you like me to send the note without it?\n\nSuggested email (ready to send — tell me which option you want):\nTo: iris.jones@yahoo.com\nSubject: Loved the yoga class this morning\n\nHi Iris,\n\nJust wanted to share some quick feedback about the new yoga class I took this morning. It was a great session — relaxed but energizing, well-paced, and the instructor gave clear guidance and helpful adjustments. I left feeling refreshed and would definitely go again.\n\nWould you like to join next time?\n\nBest,\n\nOptions — tell me which to do:\n- Send this now as-is (no instructor name).\n- Send and include instructor name (tell me the name).\n- Save this as a draft.\n- Edit the message first.",
