      "agent_response": "I couldn't find any record of that brunch in your emails or in your saved memories. Do you remember what you had, or would you like me to send a short note without naming the specific dish?\n\nSuggested email (ready to send — tell me which option you want):\n\nTo: iris.johnson@outlook.com\nSubject: Brunch at the cozy cafe on Elm Street\n\nHi Iris,\n\nJust wanted to share that I had brunch with Sarah at the cozy cafe on Elm Street. The place was charming and the food was delicious — I left feeling really satisfied. Would love to take you there sometime.\n\nBest,\n\nWhat would you like me to do?\n- Send this now as-is.\n- Send and include the specific dish (tell me what you had).\n- Save this as a draft.\n- Edit the message first (tell me what to change).",
