            "text": "You tried making homemade pasta from scratch and a rich Bolognese sauce (from the cooking class you took with Chef Maria).\n\nDraft email I'll send to bob.jones@yahoo.com — please confirm or ask edits:\n\nSubject: Tried a pasta recipe from \"The Italian Kitchen: Pasta Perfection\"\n\nHi Bob,\n\nI wanted to share that I tried a recipe from The Italian Kitchen: Pasta Perfection — I made fresh pasta from scratch and a rich Bolognese sauce. The pasta turned out with a lovely texture and the sauce was hearty and full of flavor. I felt really proud of how it came together and would definitely make it again.\n\nHope you're doing well — let me know if you want the recipe or to try it together sometime.\n\nBest,\n\nShould I send this now to bob.jones@yahoo.com, save it as a draft, or would you like any changes?"
